    {
      "id": "4NcEqjSEpYu1opRU-juqB",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2571.628841942502,
      "y": 838.1351577997998,
      "width": 552.4398803710938,
      "height": 162,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 4,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 747089703,
      "version": 24,
      "versionNonce": 300176105,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1784894466887,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "解释：\n1 根据全局中handler_id的值判断输入是否已被命令进行解释器\n成功解释。如果没有那么继续使用命令结束解释器解释键程。\n2 wait_input模式，当解释器发现命令属于wait_input模式，会\n设置leader_hook_flag=false,key_hook_flag=false\n此时不再捕获space、caps以及众多普通按键",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "解释：\n1 根据全局中handler_id的值判断输入是否已被命令进行解释器\n成功解释。如果没有那么继续使用命令结束解释器解释键程。\n2 wait_input模式，当解释器发现命令属于wait_input模式，会\n设置leader_hook_flag=false,key_hook_flag=false\n此时不再捕获space、caps以及众多普通按键",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
